4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFihyYkvtTsQ7kNvwHHem0w&_nc_oc=Adp_-Gx_BneSz2C-IUYfUhmlgkooqn6ikpqbgqdLJUQmUhHQ_aUuYgYh1YYNMZ2ev1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBUUTZXPfCuXZUCLIr6Bthi5cOJfz3BB7BVyi_sjRf5Nw&oe=6A6605D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7PkNcwgV9dAQ7kNvwFq9Ztt&_nc_oc=AdrZIp1aofi4dth4DNaKFnuuF2PwZN5bctLU3qRiFwQnkDEeT9TRwhceqCzACujRgZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQADqZoD9UPtxyvQSaM_lK64eyf8LRUTLKBg2y84gjfKsw&oe=6A660AB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yhS9SAYhCqsQ7kNvwFU9ugC&_nc_oc=AdpAV2K1tZ-3TGmtn7L3QmRr9uk3X6wVwYpzxIIHVQqH78NRtLT84bKZy8Khzh3W-1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC-sg6cG8Xuzc5uwiCOKPXlW1VyBJaM2w42bLCca7r3NA&oe=6A661855"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p